{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05200","headline":"岁晚还京台望城阙成口号先赠交亲 · 卢僎","name":"岁晚还京台望城阙成口号先赠交亲","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"紫陌开行树，朱城出晚霞。\n犹怜惯去国，疑是梦还家。\n风弱知催柳，林青觉待花。\n交亲望归骑，几处拥年华。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢僎","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05200.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05200","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}